## Fix UC table-comment import bind placeholders

Context: RIL / Jio POC on v0.7.0 imported column comments via DESCRIBE but
table-level descriptions stayed empty despite SELECT grants. App Logs showed
PARSE_SYNTAX_ERROR at '%' — Databricks SQL Connector does not rewrite pyformat
%s markers (use_inline_params=False), so information_schema queries were sent
verbatim. Same bug in probe_schema_has_tables. list_functions already used ?.
Same change as 0.7.2; develop changelog under v0.8.0.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/databricks/uc/UnityCatalog.py
   get_table_comment and probe_schema_has_tables now bind with qmark `?`.
2. tests/units/core/test_unity_catalog.py
   Added UnityCatalog unit tests (file was missing on develop) asserting
   executed SQL uses `?` and contains no `%s`.

